      "message": "This is going to be a great cleanup. Though a few points need to be resolved first.\n\nI still didn\u0027t quite follow all processes so I might still have follow up comments.\n\nWe should find a good place to clean up TouchSpotController when display disconnects. Otherwise it\u0027s a resource leak. We can change the PointerControllerInterface if necessary.\n\nAs for resource loading I think current arrangement is already good enough. TouchSpotController is only created when someone is setting some spots on that display.",
